The $m=0$ (top right panel) and $m=1$ (bottom left panel) fields are shown in the $xz$ plane, while the $m=2$ (bottom right panel) field is plotted in the $xy$ (equatorial) plane. The $m=-1$ and $m=-2$ fields, not shown here, have the same structure but rotated 45 degrees counterclockwise around the azimuthal axis (Cartesian grid $z$ axis). The total energy density displays the same spherical shell morphology in 3 plane views, $xy$, $yz$ and $xz$.}
