Finite-index subgroups in a 3-manifold group $\pi_1M$ bijectively correspond to finite coverings of $M$ (marked with basepoints). We also use \autoref{DEF: corresponding} for the case of 3-manifold groups. 
\begin{definition}\label{DEF: corresponding cover}
